stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingLocal: Smart Rule Event / Session End

    state "Local Room Outbox" as RoomLayer {
        PendingLocal: State = PENDING (syncedToCloud = 0)
        PendingLocal: Stored in cloud_outbox & smart_rule_executions
        PendingLocal: Survives App Crash & OS Process Death
    }

    state "WorkManager Execution" as SyncLayer {
        CheckNetwork: Constraints Check (CONNECTED network)
        CheckNetwork --> InFlight: WorkManager starts SyncOutboxWorker
        InFlight: Read pending batches from Room
        InFlight --> FirebasePush: Write to Firebase Realtime Database
        
        state "Firebase RTDB Server Validation" as CloudLayer {
            FirebasePush --> SecurityRules: Evaluate database.rules.json
            SecurityRules --> RuleValid: Auth == Owner && Schema Valid && Timestamp Valid
            SecurityRules --> RuleRejected: Permission Denied / Extra Fields / Invalid Type
        }

        RuleValid --> SyncedSuccess: Write Acknowledged (Atomic 200 OK)
        
        FirebasePush --> NetworkFailure: Socket Timeout / Device Offline
        NetworkFailure --> ExponentialBackoff: Retry with Exponential Delay (30s, 60s, 120s...)
        ExponentialBackoff --> CheckNetwork
    }

    SyncedSuccess --> SyncedLocal: Update Room (status = SYNCED, syncedToCloud = 1)
    SyncedLocal --> [*]: Outbox Entry Purged or Archived

    RuleRejected --> DeadLetter: Mark status = FAILED (Fatal Schema Error)
    DeadLetter --> [*]: Developer Lab Diagnostic Flag
